# Change Log

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.


## [0.8.2] - 2026-11-24
- [change] Make the fxy core zero-runtime-dependency; move mpmath and eday to the calc/cas/lab extras.
- [change] Lower the supported Python floor to 3.8 and use a Python-3.8-compatible setuptools build floor.
- [change] Make legacy calculator/environment commands fail with actionable extra-install guidance when their stacks are absent.
- [docs] Emphasize portability and lean resolver semantics for Termux and other small Python environments.

## [0.8.1] - 2026-11-24
- [docs] Reframe fxy around reusable computational vocabularies and profiles.
- [docs] Make GitHub-hosted profiles, dependency approval, inspection, and reproducibility the primary workflow.
- [deprecate] Treat legacy star-import environments and launcher presets as compatibility interfaces for new work.

## [0.8.0] - 2026-11-24
- [add] Versioned namespace profiles: calc/v1, cas/v1, lab/v1.
- [add] GitHub-hosted declarative profiles via owner/repo[@ref].
- [add] Cached remote profiles with explicit dependency-install approval.
- [add] Modern pyproject.toml packaging and GitHub Actions tests.
- [change] Keep the default install small; scientific/GUI stacks are available as extras.
- [change] CLI and QtConsole helpers use the current Python interpreter and real Jupyter kernelspec discovery.
- [fix] Remove the obsolete appdirs-based QtConsole kernel-state check.

## [0.5.6] - 2024-02-28
- [change] Refactor philosophy of the package. Responsible only for two things: emulating CAS and LAB environments, leave out calc, plot.

## [0.5.8] - 2024-03-04
- [add] PyQt5 dependency, for plotting.
- [fix] scipy import

## [0.5.8] - 2024-03-04
- [fix] mpmath import in CAS

## [0.6.0] - 2024-03-14
- [mod] fxy.CAS, fxy.LAB to lowercase (fxy.cas, fxy.lab)
